{"id":"wb-6-20","name":"大名府故城","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"大名府故城","text":"大名府故城，在今河北省邯郸市大名县，是北宋陪都大名府的城池遗址，以大名县大街镇大街、御营、双台三村为中心，以南门口、东门口、北门口以及铁窗口为四至，面积26平方公里。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%A4%A7%E5%90%8D%E5%BA%9C%E6%95%85%E5%9F%8E","revisionId":94823992,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=94823992","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/f1cd2ff66ecd4ee8d30a7b34.jpg","title":"大名府古城遗址博物馆_1.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E5%A4%A7%E5%90%8D%E5%BA%9C%E5%8F%A4%E5%9F%8E%E9%81%97%E5%9D%80%E5%8D%9A%E7%89%A9%E9%A6%86_1.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/9/97/%E5%A4%A7%E5%90%8D%E5%BA%9C%E5%8F%A4%E5%9F%8E%E9%81%97%E5%9D%80%E5%8D%9A%E7%89%A9%E9%A6%86_1.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"H2v5o68z","license":"CC0","licenseUrl":"http://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/deed.en","caption":"​大名府古城遗址博物馆","width":320,"height":240}}